    "title": "Former SAPD Chief William McManus serving as unpaid BCSO reserve deputy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amanda Moreno ,\n9 hours ago SAN ANTONIO — Former San Antonio Police Chief William McManus is serving as an unpaid reserve deputy with the Bexar County Sheriff’s Office, according to the agency. BCSO confirmed that McManus is a reserve with the department and does not receive wages for the role. McManus retired earlier... Read full article",
